#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:4
msgid ""
":index:`Filtering the Main Screen <user interface; main screen filtering>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:6
msgid ""
"The items displayed in the Cluster Pane and the Album Pane can be filtered "
"to allow for quickly reviewing selected information. The filter bars can be "
"displayed or hidden from the :menuselection:`\"View\"` menu, or using the "
"keyboard shortcut :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+F`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:11
msgid ""
"To filter the items in one of the panes, simply select one or more filters "
"and enter the filter text to use for that pane. The items will be displayed "
"or hidden based on the filter criteria entered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:14
msgid "Text Filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:16
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Filters` button is clicked, a dialog will be displayed "
"to allow you to select the filters to use for that pane."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:27
msgid "When filtering is applied, items will only be displayed if:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:29
msgid "no filters are selected or no filter text has been entered;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:30
msgid "no tags are found that match the selected filters;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:31
msgid ""
"a tag is found that matches one of the selected filters and the filter text "
"is found within the tag value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:33
msgid ""
"Items will not be displayed if one or more tags were found in the selected "
"filters and the filter text was not found in any values of those tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:36
msgid "Status Filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the Album Pane, albums can be filtered based on their modified and/or "
"complete status. When the :guilabel:`Status` button is clicked, a menu will "
"be displayed to allow you to select the status types to display."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:42
#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:47
msgid "Status filter menu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:51
msgid "The list of filterable status types are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:56
msgid "Status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:57
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:58
msgid "Modified"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:59
msgid "Album has pending modifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:60
msgid "Unmodified"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:61
msgid "Album has no pending modifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:62
msgid "Complete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:63
msgid "Album has a single file assigned to each track"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:64
msgid "Incomplete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:65
msgid ""
"Album has one or more tracks with no file assigned or multiple files assigned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:67
msgid ""
"When status filtering is applied, album items will only be displayed if both "
"their modified and complete status match one of the selected status types. "
"For example, if an album has a single audio file assigned to each track and "
"there are differences in the metadata between the files and tracks such that "
"changes will be made to the tags when saving, then the album will only be "
"displayed if both the **Complete** and **Modified** status types are "
"selected. In this case selecting either or both of the **Unmodified** and "
"**Incomplete** status codes has no impact on the display of the album."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/main_screen_filter.rst:71
msgid ""
"Unchecking both the **Modified** and **Unmodified** status types will cause "
"all albums to be filtered out. Similarly, unchecking both **Complete** and "
"**Incomplete** status types will cause all albums to be filtered out as well."
msgstr ""
